    /// For a `TimingPath` symbol (a specify-block path declaration, e.g.
    /// `(a *> b) = 1;`): its connection kind -- full (`*>`) or parallel
    /// (`=>`). [`TimingPathConnectionKind::Full`] if `self` is not a
    /// TimingPath symbol. A direct field read
